# README.md — Template Definition

## Expression

- Short sentences, itemized
- Facts only, no subjective evaluation
- zh/en synced (en mirrors zh)

## Section Hierarchy

### H1 (required)
- Project name

### H2 (required)
- Overview: one-line positioning
- Install: steps (items)
- Usage: entry points and basic operations (items)

### H3 (required)
- none

## Optional Sections

- [optional] Maintenance entry: structure registration / progress / requirement docs guide
- [optional] FAQ: question / answer table
- [optional] Changelog: version / date / change
